ormal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Blowing of the Wind of Life - Constantly Active. In this form, the Drive cost is reduced in 50% except for the Conflict Resolution, which it has 10% added to it. For each turn, the creature gains 1 \Drive, and after reaching the necessary amount, if it is near its original body or a compatible host, automatically uses the &quot;Wind of Life Resurrection&quot; Special Skill to return to the former combat state.</p></body>)/Rect[26.5091 17.0131 258.873 80.2075]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj34 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(            0)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/NM(32e97419c2e44784aa5108032afb01f3)/Page 0/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p>            0</p></body>)/Rect[270.243 33.8336 336.843 46.0336]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj35 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(            --)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240907220807-03'00')/NM(a4b931df5e114f269030b80d0ce7ca31)/Page 0/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p>            --</p></body>)/Rect[442.291 715.966 508.891 728.166]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj36 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(          --)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv